      "updated": 1760127392447,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Line 28: i = 0, i < row 2? yes, run this loop\nis 4[0][1]? no (this cell is false), so skip if condition\ni = 1, i <2? yes, continue loop\nis 4[1][1]?? no (cell is false), so skip if condition\ni = 2, i < 2? no, stop loop\n\nLine 34: maxLeft = Math.min(1, 1) = 1\nis i (1) <= 1? yes, run loop\nis 4[1][0]? no, skip if condition\ni = 2, 2 <= 1? no, stop loop\n\nLine 41: maxRight = Math.min(2, 4-1-1 = 2) = 2\ni = 1, is 1 <= 2? yes, continue loop\nis 4[1][2]? cell is true, so return false \nExit function, go back to for loop in nQueens function ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Line 28: i = 0, i < row 2? yes, run this loop\nis 4[0][1]? no (this cell is false), so skip if condition\ni = 1, i <2? yes, continue loop\nis 4[1][1]?? no (cell is false), so skip if condition\ni = 2, i < 2? no, stop loop\n\nLine 34: maxLeft = Math.min(1, 1) = 1\nis i (1) <= 1? yes, run loop\nis 4[1][0]? no, skip if condition\ni = 2, 2 <= 1? no, stop loop\n\nLine 41: maxRight = Math.min(2, 4-1-1 = 2) = 2\ni = 1, is 1 <= 2? yes, continue loop\nis 4[1][2]? cell is true, so return false \nExit function, go back to for loop in nQueens function ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
