      "updated": 1760129173186,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Line 28: i = 0, i < row 2? yes, run this loop\nis 4[0][3]? no (this cell is false), so skip if condition\ni = 1, i <2? yes, continue loop\nis 4[1][3]?? no, skip condition\ni = 2, i < 2? no, break loop\n\nLine: 34: maxLeft = Math.min(1, 2) = 1\ni = 1, i<= 1? yes, run loop\nis 4[1][2]? cell is true, so return false\nExit function, go back to for loop in nQueens function ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Line 28: i = 0, i < row 2? yes, run this loop\nis 4[0][3]? no (this cell is false), so skip if condition\ni = 1, i <2? yes, continue loop\nis 4[1][3]?? no, skip condition\ni = 2, i < 2? no, break loop\n\nLine: 34: maxLeft = Math.min(1, 2) = 1\ni = 1, i<= 1? yes, run loop\nis 4[1][2]? cell is true, so return false\nExit function, go back to for loop in nQueens function ",
