      "updated": 1760211173320,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "continue for loop, iter 3: col = 2\nreturned at Line 18: count += 1;\nLine 19: BACKTRACKING here\nchange cell back to false \n\nremove Q4\n\nfor loop: iter 4: col = 3\n\nfor loop: iter 5: col = 4\nbut col < board.length (or 4)\nloop STOPS\n\nmove onto line 22: return count (1)\n\nPOP f(3a) off Call stack\n\n",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "continue for loop, iter 3: col = 2\nreturned at Line 18: count += 1;\nLine 19: BACKTRACKING here\nchange cell back to false \n\nremove Q4\n\nfor loop: iter 4: col = 3\n\nfor loop: iter 5: col = 4\nbut col < board.length (or 4)\nloop STOPS\n\nmove onto line 22: return count (1)\n\nPOP f(3a) off Call stack\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
