      "updated": 1760212342085,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Back in f(1a): nQueens(4, row = 1)\n\ncontinue for loop: iter 4, col 3\n\nLine 19: BACKTRACKING here\nchange cell back to false\nremove Q2\n\nfor loop: iter 5, col 4\nbut col < board.length (or 4)\nloop STOPS\n\nmove onto line 22: return count (1)\n\nPOP f(1a) off Call Stack\n\n",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Back in f(1a): nQueens(4, row = 1)\n\ncontinue for loop: iter 4, col 3\n\nLine 19: BACKTRACKING here\nchange cell back to false\nremove Q2\n\nfor loop: iter 5, col 4\nbut col < board.length (or 4)\nloop STOPS\n\nmove onto line 22: return count (1)\n\nPOP f(1a) off Call Stack\n\n",
